WEBVTT

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:11.710
Choose Analytics in the side menu.

00:00:12.632 --> 00:00:17.604
Click Last 28 days.

00:00:17.854 --> 00:00:23.854
Check that the Views tile shows a number.

00:00:25.623 --> 00:00:31.623
Check that the Finished
watching tile shows a percent.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:40.551
Scroll to Views each day.

00:00:40.801 --> 00:00:45.908
Scroll to Top titles.

00:00:46.158 --> 00:00:51.144
Click Sort by Likes.

00:00:51.394 --> 00:00:56.365
Scroll to Devices.
